📉 Stock Prices Analysis
This project analyzes historical stock price data to explore trends, patterns and simple forecasting approaches.
The goal is to understand market behavior using visualizations and basic time-based features.

📌 Features
Data cleaning and preprocessing
Time-series exploration 
Visualizations of price history
Feature engineering
Simple forecasting experiments and model evaluation

🛠 Tools Used
Python · Pandas · NumPy · Matplotlib · Seaborn · Scikit-learn · Jupyter Notebook

📁 Main File
Stock Prices.ipynb — complete analysis, visualizations and modelling steps
